# What Vercel does not need in the upload.
#
# Without this the CLI uploads the working directory whole — which meant 7.6 GB
# and a deploy that never finished, almost all of it the Angular build cache.
# The build runs `npm ci && npm run build` on Vercel's side, so none of this is
# read there.
node_modules
.angular
dist
android
companion
.git
.github
supabase
tools
*.apk
*.keystore
*.env
